  "zh": "# BLG 夺冠引爆电竞圈，星舰回收与央行宽松并行，AI 能耗隐忧与无人机战术革新同现。\n## 电竞体育\n- **BLG 夺冠 S16 总决赛**：中国战队时隔五年登顶世界赛，一穿四击溃韩国赛区四强，含金量拉满重塑 LPL 荣光。\n- **Bin 达成 LPL 首位大满贯上单**：从亚运会到世界赛全满贯，Bin 用泪水与数据终结世一上争议，书写中国上单新历史。\n## 科技前沿\n- **SpaceX 星舰十五次试飞筷子夹火箭**：超重型火箭再次精准回收塔架，全流程可复用迈出关键步，火星时间表再提速。\n- **生成式 AI 处理非英语能耗显著更高**：Token 化差异导致算力成本飙升，多语言落地隐形账单不容忽视。\n## 财经政策\n- **央行发布重大货币政策调整信号**：逆周期调节力度加大，降准降息预期升温，流动性宽松意图明确。\n- **食品包装明春禁用零添加表述**：监管堵住概念营销漏洞，消费者将回归配料表本源判断品质。\n## 国际视野\n- **乌克兰单夜发射近千架无人机袭俄**：大规模自主协同攻击改写现代战争形态，防空体系面临饱和拦截极限。",
  "en": "# BLG wins Worlds after 5yrs; Starship caught, PBOC eases; AI energy gap, drone swarm tactics.\n## Esports\n- **BLG Wins S16 Worlds**：China ends five-year drought with a 3-1 sweep of four LCK teams, crowning the most dominant run in LoL history.\n- **Bin LPL Grand Slam**：From Asian Games to Worlds, Bin completes the full set, silencing best top debates with tears and stats.\n## Tech Frontier\n- **Starship 15 Catch**：Super Heavy booster returns to the launch tower again, proving rapid reuse viability for Mars missions.\n- **AI Non-English Cost**：Tokenization overhead inflates compute costs for low-resource languages, a hidden tax on global deployment.\n## Finance & Policy\n- **PBOC Policy Easing**：Rate cut and RRR expectations rise as central bank doubles down on counter-cyclical stimulus.\n- **Zero Additive Ban**：Regulation effective March 2025 kills misleading marketing, forcing transparency via ingredient lists.\n## Global Affairs\n- **Ukraine Drone Attack**：Mass autonomous swarm overwhelms Russian defenses, redefining air warfare with sheer scale and coordination."
